{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-pro-16-1","title":"Proverbs 16:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":16,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":16,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>9; 19:21; 20:24; 21:1; 2Ch 18:31; Ezr 7:27; Ne 1:11; Ps 10:17; 119:36 Jer 10:23; 32:39,40; Eze 36:26,27; 2Co 8:16; Php 2:13; Jas 1:16-18 and. Ex 4:11,12,15; Jer 1:7-9; Mt 10:19,20; Lu 12:11,12; 21:14,15</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-16-2","title":"Proverbs 16:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":16,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":16,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>the ways. 25; 21:2; 30:12; 1Sa 15:13,14; Ps 36:2; Jer 2:22,23; Lu 18:9-11 Ro 7:7-9 but. 5:21; 24:12; 1Sa 16:7; Isa 26:7; Jer 17:10; Da 5:27; Lu 16:15 Re 2:18,23</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-16-3","title":"Proverbs 16:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":16,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":16,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>Commit. Heb. Roll. thy works. Job 5:8; Ps 37:4,5; 55:22; Mt 6:25-34; Lu 12:22; Php 4:6; 1Pe 5:7 thy thoughts. Job 22:28; Isa 7:5-7</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-16-4","title":"Proverbs 16:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":16,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":16,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>Lord. Isa 43:7,21; Ro 11:36; Re 4:11 yea. Job 21:30; Ro 9:22; 1Pe 2:8; 2Pe 2:3,9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-16-5","title":"Proverbs 16:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":16,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":16,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>that. 6:16,17; 8:13; Job 40:12; Jas 4:6 though. 11:21 unpunished. Heb. held innocent. Ex 20:7; Isa 3:11; Ro 2:8,9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-16-6","title":"Proverbs 16:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":16,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":16,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>mercy. 20:28; Ps 85:10; Da 4:27; Mic 7:18-20; Lu 11:41; Joh 15:2; Ac 15:9 1Pe 1:22 by the. 8:13; 14:16,27; Ge 20:11; Ne 5:9,15; Job 1:1-8; 28:28; 2Co 7:1 Eph 5:21</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-16-7","title":"Proverbs 16:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":16,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":16,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>please. Ps 69:31; Ro 8:31; Php 4:18; Col 1:10; 3:20; Heb 13:21; 1Jo 3:22 he. Ge 27:41; 32:6,7,28; 33:4; Jer 15:11; Ac 9:1,2,19,20</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-16-8","title":"Proverbs 16:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":16,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":16,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>is. 15:16; Ps 37:16; 1Ti 6:6-9 great. 21:6,7; Jer 17:11; Mic 6:10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-16-9","title":"Proverbs 16:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":16,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":16,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>1; 19:21; 20:24; 21:30; Ps 37:23; Isa 46:10; Jer 10:23</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-16-10","title":"Proverbs 16:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":16,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":16,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>A divine sentence. Heb. Divination 12,13; Ge 44:5,15; De 17:18-20; 2Sa 23:3,4; Ps 45:6,7; 72:1-4 Ps 99:4; Isa 32:1,2; Jer 23:5,6 transgresseth. Ho 10:4; Am 5:7; 6:12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-16-11","title":"Proverbs 16:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":16,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":16,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>just. 11:1; 20:10,23; Le 19:35,36; De 25:13-15; Eze 45:10; Ho 12:7 Am 8:5; Mic 6:11 weights. Heb. stones.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-16-12","title":"Proverbs 16:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":16,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":16,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>an. 28:9; De 25:16; Lu 12:48 for. 20:18; 25:5; 29:14; Ps 99:4; Re 19:11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-16-13","title":"Proverbs 16:13","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":16,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":16,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>14:35; 22:11; Ps 101:5-7</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-16-14","title":"Proverbs 16:14","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":16,"verseStart":14,"chapterEnd":16,"verseEnd":14},"content":"<p>wrath. 19:12; 20:2; Da 3:13-25; Lu 12:4,5 messengers. 17:11; 2Ki 6:31-33; Mr 6:27 but. Ec 10:4; Ac 12:20; 2Co 5:20</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-16-15","title":"Proverbs 16:15","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":16,"verseStart":15,"chapterEnd":16,"verseEnd":15},"content":"<p>the light. 19:12; Job 29:23,24; Ps 4:6; 21:6; Ac 2:28 his. Job 29:23; Ps 30:5; 72:6; Ho 6:3; Zec 10:1</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-16-16","title":"Proverbs 16:16","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":16,"verseStart":16,"chapterEnd":16,"verseEnd":16},"content":"<p>3:15-18; 4:7; 8:10,11,19; Job 28:13-28; Ps 119:127; Ec 7:12 Mt 16:26; Lu 12:21</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-16-17","title":"Proverbs 16:17","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":16,"verseStart":17,"chapterEnd":16,"verseEnd":17},"content":"<p>highway. 4:24-27; Isa 35:8; Ac 10:35; 24:16; Tit 2:10-14 he. 10:9; 19:16; Mt 24:13; Heb 10:39; Jude 1:21,24; Re 3:10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-16-18","title":"Proverbs 16:18","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":16,"verseStart":18,"chapterEnd":16,"verseEnd":18},"content":"<p>11:2; 17:19; 18:12; 29:23; Es 3:5; 6:6; 7:10; Isa 2:11,12 Isa 37:10-13,38; Da 4:30-37; 5:22,24; Ob 1:3,4; Mt 26:33-35,74 Ro 11:20; 1Ti 3:6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-16-19","title":"Proverbs 16:19","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":16,"verseStart":19,"chapterEnd":16,"verseEnd":19},"content":"<p>to be. Ps 34:18; 138:6; Isa 57:15; Mt 5:3; Lu 1:51-53; 18:13,14 than. Ex 15:9; Isa 9:3; 10:6,13-15; 53:12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-16-20","title":"Proverbs 16:20","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":16,"verseStart":20,"chapterEnd":16,"verseEnd":20},"content":"<p>handleth. or, understandeth. 8:35; 13:15; 17:2; 19:8; 24:3-5; Ge 41:38-40; Da 1:19-21; Mt 10:16 whoso. 22:19,20; 1Ch 5:20; Ps 2:12; 34:8; 125:1; 146:5; Isa 26:3,4; 30:18 Jer 17:7,8; Da 3:28; 6:23; Eph 1:12,13</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-16-21","title":"Proverbs 16:21","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":16,"verseStart":21,"chapterEnd":16,"verseEnd":21},"content":"<p>wise. 23; 10:8; 23:15; 1Ki 3:12; Ro 16:19; Jas 3:17 the sweetness. 24; 15:7; 27:9; Ps 45:2; Ec 12:10; Isa 50:4; Lu 4:22; Joh 7:46</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-16-22","title":"Proverbs 16:22","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":16,"verseStart":22,"chapterEnd":16,"verseEnd":22},"content":"<p>a well-spring. 10:11; 13:14; 14:27; 18:4; Joh 5:24; 6:63,68 the instruction. 15:2,28; Mt 15:14; 23:16-26; Lu 6:39,40</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-16-23","title":"Proverbs 16:23","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":16,"verseStart":23,"chapterEnd":16,"verseEnd":23},"content":"<p>heart. 15:28; 22:17,18; Ps 37:30,31; 45:1; Mt 12:34,35; Col 3:16 teacheth. Heb. maketh wise.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-16-24","title":"Proverbs 16:24","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":16,"verseStart":24,"chapterEnd":16,"verseEnd":24},"content":"<p>Pleasant. 12:18; 15:23,26; 23:16; 25:11,12; 27:9; De 32:2; So 4:11 Joh 20:19-21 an. 24:13,14; Ps 19:10; 119:103; Jer 15:16 health. 3:8; 4:22</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-16-25","title":"Proverbs 16:25","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":16,"verseStart":25,"chapterEnd":16,"verseEnd":25},"content":"<p>12:26; 14:12; Isa 28:15-19; Joh 7:47-49; 9:40; Ac 26:9; 2Co 13:5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-16-26","title":"Proverbs 16:26","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":16,"verseStart":26,"chapterEnd":16,"verseEnd":26},"content":"<p>He. Heb. The soul of him. laboureth. 9:12; 14:23; Ec 6:7; 1Th 4:11,12; 2Th 3:8-12 craveth it of him. Heb. boweth unto him.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-16-27","title":"Proverbs 16:27","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":16,"verseStart":27,"chapterEnd":16,"verseEnd":27},"content":"<p>An ungodly man. Heb. a man of Belial. 1Sa 25:17; 2Sa 20:1 diggeth. 2:4; Ps 17:14,15; Isa 5:18; Hab 2:13 in. Ps 52:2-4; 57:4; Jas 3:6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-16-28","title":"Proverbs 16:28","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":16,"verseStart":28,"chapterEnd":16,"verseEnd":28},"content":"<p>froward. 6:14,19; 15:18; 18:8; 26:20-22; 29:22; 30:33; 1Ti 6:3-5; Jas 3:14-16 soweth. Heb. sendeth forth. a whisperer. 17:9; Ge 3:1-13; 1Sa 24:9; Ro 1:29; 2Co 12:20</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-16-29","title":"Proverbs 16:29","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":16,"verseStart":29,"chapterEnd":16,"verseEnd":29},"content":"<p>1:10-14; 2:12-15; 3:31; 1Sa 19:11,17; 22:7-9; 23:19-21; Ne 6:13 2Pe 3:17</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-16-30","title":"Proverbs 16:30","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":16,"verseStart":30,"chapterEnd":16,"verseEnd":30},"content":"<p>shutteth. 6:12-14; 10:10; Isa 6:10; Mt 13:15; Joh 3:20 moving. 27; Mic 7:3; Mt 14:7,8; 27:23-26</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-16-31","title":"Proverbs 16:31","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":16,"verseStart":31,"chapterEnd":16,"verseEnd":31},"content":"<p>hoary. 20:29; Le 19:32; Job 32:6,7 if. Ge 47:7-10; 1Sa 12:2-5; 1Ch 29:10-25; Ec 4:13; Lu 1:6 Lu 2:29-36,37,38; Phm 1:9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-16-32","title":"Proverbs 16:32","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":16,"verseStart":32,"chapterEnd":16,"verseEnd":32},"content":"<p>that is. 14:29; 15:18; 19:11; Ps 103:8; Eph 5:1; Jas 1:19 and he. 19; 25:28; Ro 12:21; Re 3:21</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-16-33","title":"Proverbs 16:33","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":16,"verseStart":33,"chapterEnd":16,"verseEnd":33},"content":"<p>Nu 26:55-65; Jos 7:14; 18:5,10; 1Sa 14:41,42; Ne 11:1; Jon 1:7 Ac 1:26</p>"}]}